WEBVTT

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.720
Hey, Yuki...

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.600
If only more people were like you,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.190
I would...

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:54.720
Only I know your pain.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.220
Your uncertainty...

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.560
Your loneliness...

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:05.210
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:11.700
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.960
I will not betray you!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:06.480
Uzuki-kun, where are the children?

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:08.490
Look. They're over there.

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.000
What is this?

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.920
Who would do such a thing?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.130
I'll help you.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:21.890
Thanks.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.880
Just kidding!

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:29.600
Uzuki-kun! What are you doing?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.380
You're going on and on about Uzuki-kun,

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.880
but who the hell is he?

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:46.880
Lost Days and White Future

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:53.220
What a shame. He dodged it.

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:56.430
This body's just too slow.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.010
You're not Uzuki-kun.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:02.920
That's what I've been telling you.
What are you, stupid?

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:05.300
Duras...

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.680
So then you can tell, huh?

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:20.870
My name is Bayu. I'm a Duras,
just as you said.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:24.860
But I'm no lowly lesser demon.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:28.030
I'm a Mid-Villain.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.990
A Mid-Villain?

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:33.330
You mean you don't know?

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:37.080
We Duras have ranks.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.690
The lowest are known as Nidatorehi.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:42.060
Then are the Mid-Villains.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.920
Above them are the Opasts.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:50.130
How did you recognize me as a Duras,
not knowing even that much...

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.890
You're no ordinary human, are you?

00:04:58.760 --> 00:04:59.930
Yuki.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:05.560
You're the reason Uzuki-kun hadn't
been acting like himself lately.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:08.190
I just gave him power.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:15.280
He hated you so much,
he wanted you dead.

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.750
That's a lie...

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.920
Didn't you get his letter?

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.060
Sakurai Yuki, die!!

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:27.090
<i>No one needs you.</i>

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:34.380
I know no one needs me.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.640
Is the shock too much for you?

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:46.940
Well, that just makes my job easier.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:52.230
It seems you cause all kinds
of problems for us,

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.690
so I've been asked to kill you.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.120
By Reiga-sama!

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:00.630
Yuki!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:09.880
Tsukumo-kun!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.840
How brave.

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:20.430
Now that I think about it, I recall there are
some reckless idiots among the humans.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:24.940
You're a Zweilt Guardian
of Giou, aren't you?

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.600
I'm nearly there! But this...

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:47.830
Zess.

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:53.050
Tsukumo!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.060
Tsukumo-kun! What's wrong, Tsukumo-kun?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.550
Is this...

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.230
He'll die soon.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:19.590
But don't worry. You won't have to suffer.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:23.160
'Cause I'll kill you, as well.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:40.850
Now I'll become an Opast, too.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.860
Piece of cake.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.680
What is that?

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.000
Zess-san.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:07.480
Are you all right?

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:12.090
Yes. But Tsukumo-kun tried
to protect me, and...

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:15.020
We need to get him to a hospital.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.430
It's pointless...

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:22.380
No ordinary doctor can heal that wound.

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:24.370
All he can do is await death.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.160
I just need to kill you.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:26.890
What?

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:30.680
If you die, the wound will cease spreading.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:34.830
A Giou physician should be
able to handle the rest.

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.230
What?

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:40.880
Don't get ahead of yourself.
I'm a Mid-Villain-

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:42.210
Don't worry.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.870
I will destroy you in one blow.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.830
What's this unbelievable magic power?

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:53.130
The bloody cross...

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:57.910
You're Brand Zess...?

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:01.890
Of the sinful betrayer clan?!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:06.850
I never considered myself
one of your allies.

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:11.310
Betrayers? Is Zess-san a Duras?

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.770
Betrayal is a sin.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.430
Did you say something?

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:19.240
No.

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:22.490
Am I the sinner, or...

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.860
What are you doing?

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:30.470
If I die, this human will die, too!
Don't you understand that?

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:32.330
What do I care?

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:37.550
Wait!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.970
Please. Uzuki-kun is my friend!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.130
Don't kill him!

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.870
Can you free him?

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:48.040
No. Only Tsukumo can do that.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:55.980
Where do you think you're looking?!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:16.980
Zess-san.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.210
I'm fine.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:21.670
Stay back.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.620
They're all protecting me.

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:34.900
They're all getting hurt because of me.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:41.360
But I can't do anything. I... I...

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:45.890
I don't want anyone else hurt.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:52.950
Yuki-chan?

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.650
Stop.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.340
Please stop!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:10.160
So you've awakened, Yuki.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.940
God's Light...

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:26.360
What a beautiful fountain of light.

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:31.880
It's pure and full of kindness.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:35.930
So why do I feel a bit sad?

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.470
Let's go.

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:47.430
Are you sure?

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:53.180
Now that Yuki's awakened, he'll
have more than enough power.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:58.140
I'm heading back, but you
stay here and bring Yuki.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:01.150
Do you really think he'll come?

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:02.860
I'm sure he will.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:07.030
It's his only option now.

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.620
Understood.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:13.290
I guess I didn't need it this time...

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:20.590
Stop! What is this light?

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:28.300
It's not my fault. It's not just me. I...

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:29.550
Uzuki-kun?

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:31.880
You're Uzuki-kun, aren't you?

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.390
Stay away!

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:37.180
Don't come near me! He's still inside!

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:39.140
No...

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:47.990
Please... Kill me while I'm still myself!

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:49.440
Uzuki-kun.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:50.770
Fine.

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:56.160
Zess-san!

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:08.010
Tsukumo!

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.430
I release you.

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:26.320
They went right through him?

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:39.580
Ashes to ashes...

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:50.340
That's what I get for sending a Mid-Villain.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:55.470
However, that power will continue to grow.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.280
I'm sure we'll meet again soon.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:03.190
Members of the clan touched by God...

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.780
Are you okay, Tsukumo?

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:12.450
Yeah, that light helped a bit.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.780
Yuki-chan?

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.000
Yuki-chan...

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:35.840
It's healed.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.220
How did...

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:44.930
Yuki-chan, you can use your power.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:50.320
By taking on their pain,
you can heal others.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.700
That's your power, Yuki-chan.

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:56.660
My power...

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.580
Don't worry, Luka.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:04.130
Someday, your pain will disappear.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.920
So don't cry,

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:10.210
Luka!

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:15.970
Why didn't you kill me, too?

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.050
I should have died, too.

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:20.890
Yuki-chan?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:30.110
There isn't any reason for
me to have survived. So why?

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:32.510
Uzuki-kun.

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.190
Are you all right?

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:40.560
I'm so happy.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:48.080
<i>You've been walking a dark path.</i>

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:59.460
Right... You were crying for me then, too.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.640
But I...

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:07.140
I'm sorry, Yuki-kun.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:15.320
I was twisted. I blamed everything
on others and hurt you...

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.060
That's not true at all.

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:25.450
When I had no friends, you alone
talked to me, Uzuki-kun.

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:29.960
I was really happy when you did that.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:35.820
Thank you for being my friend.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:53.840
Asahi Orphanage

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:06.190
Sakurai Yuki

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.130
Yuki-chan's taking a long time.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.610
Yeah.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.080
Yuki-kun!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.220
Good morning!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.350
Good morning.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:30.130
Off to school already?

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.990
No. I'm going to Tokyo.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:35.070
What? Why?

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.320
Lucky...

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.960
Are the children okay?

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:40.820
Yeah.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:45.930
Thanks to the prescription I got from the doctor,
they shouldn't remember anything from yesterday.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.120
I see...

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.620
No!

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:54.140
Stay away! I'm scared! I'm so scared!

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:09.020
It's okay. Please don't cry.

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:25.370
If I stay here, will the Duras attack again?

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.440
Yes.

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:32.830
I knew it.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.290
Tell me...

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:42.030
I was abandoned when I was born and
hated for my strange powers...

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.670
Hurting others...

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:48.010
I'm completely unwanted,
without a place anywhere!

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:52.500
Why was I even born?

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:59.400
Why? I'm not...

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:01.390
I'm here.

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.900
Come with me.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:09.350
I will not betray you.

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:24.260
Yuki-kun! Yuki-kun!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:25.740
What's wrong?

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:29.220
Nothing. Well, I've got to go.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:30.750
Goodbye.

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:35.480
No, Yuki-kun.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:39.940
Don't you mean "see you
later," not "goodbye"?

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.080
Yeah. See you later.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.910
See you!

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:02.080
Sorry to make you wait.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:04.190
Is this all your luggage?

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:05.260
Yes.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:12.250
Nice to meet you. I am Takashiro-sama's
secretary, Shikibe Ibuki.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:15.980
I'll be taking you to Tokyo today.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.840
The pleasure's mine.

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:24.340
I'm sorry you have to leave the
children like this, Yuki-chan.

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:30.030
But we can't fight without you. I know
I'm just making selfish excuses, but...

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:32.290
But...

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:33.680
No.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:37.160
This is my decision.

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:39.850
Yuki-chan...

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:42.940
I look forward to working with you.

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:46.450
With you, too, Zess-san.

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.130
Luka...

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:54.620
Luka Crosszeria. That's
my real name, Master.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.190
Luka-san...

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.390
Master?

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.980
Just call me Luka.

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.900
What do you mean, call you Luka?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:08.230
And how is that your real
name? What's Zess, then?

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:09.620
It's just a codename.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.890
Why only tell me your codename?

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:16.410
Why would I give some random
girl my real name?

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:19.500
I'm just some girl to you?

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.750
Well, I'll never call you
anything else again-

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.260
Luka, Luka, Luka!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.980
Cut it out, Toko-chan.

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:36.640
Yuki-chan.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:39.520
Welcome back!

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:41.740
Toko-chan.

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:43.440
Welcome back, Yuki.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:44.810
I'm home.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.860
If there's someone extending
their hand to me...

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:53.800
If there's someone who needs me...

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.950
I'll find something only I can do.

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:03.290
Now, I can only move forward.

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:36.550
Yuki.

00:23:36.550 --> 00:23:38.050
What is it, Luka?

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:40.660
Electric toothbrushes are amazing.

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:41.350
What?

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:44.680
You don't need to move your own
hand to brush your teeth.

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:45.940
On top of that, it feels good.

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:46.520
A New Encounter

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:48.930
Let's make sure we don't get any cavities!

00:23:48.930 --> 00:23:50.930
Sure.
